// Oxikube vim base keymap (E11-S09), selected with `"base_keymap": "vim"` in settings.json.
//
// It is a layer, not a mode: it sits between the per-OS defaults and your own `keymap.json`, so
// your bindings still win, and it adds vim's movement and its doubled operators to the resource
// table. There is no modal emulation: typing in a field, the terminal and the manifest editor is
// exactly as without it, because every section below is scoped to `ResourceTable && !Editing`
// (the table's rows are focused, no text field has the focus) and nothing is bound in `Terminal`,
// `ManifestEditor`, `Palette`, `JumpBar` or any `Input`.
//
// What it gives the table:
//   j / k            next / previous row               (also in the defaults)
//   g g / shift-g    first / last row
//   ctrl-d / ctrl-u  half a page down / up
//   ctrl-f / ctrl-b  a page down / up
//   /                search: focus the table's filter  (also in the defaults)
//   :                the jump bar                      (the defaults' `ClusterTab` binding; this
//                    layer needs none of its own)
//   d d              delete the row or selection: the same dialog as `delete`, so the read-only
//                    block, the confirmation tier and the audit record apply unchanged
//   y y              copy the name of the cursor row
//
// Conflicts with the defaults, and what happens to them (the keymap editor shows each as an
// override of the default layer):
//   ctrl-d   the defaults (k9s) delete the selection; here it scrolls and `d d` deletes.
//   d, y     the defaults describe (`d`) and show the YAML (`y`). A bare `d` or `y` would fire
//            before its second key could arrive, so the single keys are unbound here and the two
//            views move to `g d` and `g y`. `d` and `y` keep their defaults in the detail drawer.
//
// A key that does not complete a pair does nothing destructive: `d` then `j` is `j` (the `d` is
// dropped), and an unfinished `d` times out the same way.
[
  {
    "context": "ResourceTable && !Editing",
    "bindings": {
      "g g": "resource_table::SelectFirst",
      "shift-g": "resource_table::SelectLast",
      "ctrl-d": "resource_table::SelectHalfPageDown",
      "ctrl-u": "resource_table::SelectHalfPageUp",
      "ctrl-f": "resource_table::SelectPageDown",
      "ctrl-b": "resource_table::SelectPageUp",
      "j": "resource_table::SelectNext",
      "k": "resource_table::SelectPrevious",
      "/": "resource_table::FocusFilter",
      "d d": "resource_table::DeleteSelected",
      "y y": "resource_table::CopyName",
      "d": null,
      "y": null,
      "g d": "resource_table::ViewDescribe",
      "g y": "resource_table::ViewYaml"
    }
  }
]
